```js
showSubmitBtn() {
  return this.isFormDisabled && Boolean(this.companyRecordChangeId) && shouldShowAgencyChangeSubmit(this.form)
}
```
The form is disabled in `view` mode, so the button shows when `shouldShowAgencyChangeSubmit(form)` returns true. Let me read `shouldShowAgencyChangeSubmit`.

